// Demo quest for the Phase 5B quest->overlay directives. Granted to each player in
// the @map body; the "Complete Quest" button completes it, firing BOTH directive
// forms: a declared-record reference (complete_overlay: ch1 -> overlays.amd) and an
// inline directive (on_complete: toast ...).

# [Demo Quest](demo_quest)
---
state: active
complete_overlay: ch1
on_complete: toast Quest complete!
---
Press "Complete Quest" on the Overlay Demo console to finish this quest.
